
<div class="govuk-grid-row">
    <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">
        <h1 class="govuk-heading-l">Register your organisation</h1>

        <p class="govuk-body">
            You need to register your organisation before you can register a heat network.
        </p>

        <p class="govuk-body">
            To do this, you'll need:
        </p>

        <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
            <li>a Companies House number or a valid business address</li>
            <li>your name, email address and role</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="app-button-wrapper">
            <a asp-controller="Organisation" role="button" asp-action="Start" data-module="govuk-button" draggable="false" class="govuk-button">Register your organisation</a>
        </div>
      
    </div>
</div>
